{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"一、四年。春王三月庚戌，盜殺蔡侯申。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"弒君賤者窮諸人，此其稱盜以弒何？賤乎賤者也。賤乎賤者孰謂？謂罪人也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"二、蔡公孫辰出奔吳。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"三、葬秦惠公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"四、宋人執小邾婁子。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"五、夏，蔡殺其大夫公孫歸姓、公孫霍。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"六、晉人執戎曼子赤歸于楚。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"赤者何？戎曼子之名也。其言歸于楚何？子北宮子曰：「辟伯晉而京師楚也。」","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"七、城西郛。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"八、六月辛丑，蒲社災。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"蒲社者何？亡國之社也。社者封也，其言災何？亡國之社蓋揜之，揜其上而柴其下。蒲社災，何以書？記災也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"九、秋八月甲寅，滕子結卒。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"十、冬十有二月，葬蔡昭公。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_231_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_231","textTraditional":"十一、葬滕頃公。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}